ert Putt","role":"Job Anderson","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sfmTMHjjeRhgnOhSsN7mUiQWXWt.jpg"},{"id":56616,"name":"Brett Fancy","role":"Young Tom","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bD6NgWN1Cpc5JGadTUuI4h0FbND.jpg"},{"id":2232764,"name":"Bill Sloan","role":"Scarface"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"L'isola del tesoro","overview":"Con la mappa che il capitano Billy Bones gli ha lasciato prima di morire, il giovane Jim Hawkins parte a bordo dell'Hispaniola alla ricerca del tesoro sepolto dal capitano Flint e lo troverà dopo aver sconfitto Long John Silver e la sua ciurma di pirati.","tagline":"Naviga gli oceani. Combatti i pirati. Vivi l'avventura."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Young Jim Hawkins, while running the Benbow Inn with his mother, meets Captain Billy Bones, who dies at the inn while it is beseiged by buccaneers led by Blind Pew. Jim and his mother fight off the attackers and discover Billy Bones' treasure map for which the buccaneers had come. Jim agrees to sail on the S.S. Hispaniola with Squire Trelawney and Dr. Livesey to find the treasure on a mysterious island. Upon arriving at the island, ship's cook and scallywag Long John Silver leads a mutiny of crew members who want the treasure for themselves. Jim helps the Squire and Hispaniola officers to survive the mutiny and fight back against Silver's men, who have taken over the ship.","tagline":"Sail the high seas. Battle the pirates. Live the adventure."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5Lo1f1b03MVRaW2Oe9JDzXVq7gD.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5Lo1f1b03MVRaW2Oe9JDzXVq7gD.png","language":"it","width":845,"height":264},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1UBuILNo2amKN3tQxwsBhtEzrg6.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1UBuILNo2amKN3tQxwsBhtEzrg6.png","language":"en","width":1000,"height":297}],"po